· PCM: 500 g paraffin microcapsules, latent heat >150 J/g; TEC thin‑film Bi₂Te₃, <200 g, activated only during post‑threat cooling (<3 W, <10 min).
· Graphene electroresponsive patches: adjust emissivity and porosity with <1 mW.
· Rebound skin temperature rise limited to <1 °C.

